<title>ESTONIA: NAITUSTE ISSUE CERTIFICATES TO BE TRADED.</title>
<headline>NAITUSTE ISSUE CERTIFICATES TO BE TRADED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eesti Naituste, an exhibition and fair organiser, will start trading the certificates for its share issue of new shares on the free market from March 31, the Tallinn stock exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Until the share capital increase is entered into the business register, the 400,000 subscription certificates will trade under a different name than Eesti Naituste shares, the exchange added.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
